{"title": "Drow Weapon Training", "pageid": 6562, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Drow_Weapon_Training", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Drow_Weapon_Training.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Drow_Weapon_Training.webp/300px-Drow_Weapon_Training.webp, /w/images/0/03/Drow_Weapon_Training.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Drow_Weapon_Training.webp/300px-Drow_Weapon_Training.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Drow_Weapon_Training.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Drow Weapon Training</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a> Proficiency with the Rapier, Shortsword, and Hand Crossbow.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rapiers\" title=\"Rapiers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png/25px-Rapiers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png/38px-Rapiers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png/50px-Rapiers_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rapiers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png/25px-Rapiers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Rapiers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rapiers\" title=\"Rapiers\">Rapiers</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/25px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/38px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/50px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shortswords\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/25px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\">Shortswords</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Crossbows\" title=\"Hand Crossbows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png/25px-Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png/38px-Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png/50px-Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hand Crossbows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png/25px-Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Hand_Crossbows_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Crossbows\" title=\"Hand Crossbows\">Hand Crossbows</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ver%27yll_Wenkiir\" title=\"Ver'yll Wenkiir\">Ver'yll Wenkiir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_Minthara\" title=\"Zombie Minthara\">Zombie Minthara</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> with <a href=\"/wiki/Rapiers\" title=\"Rapiers\">rapiers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\">shortswords</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Hand_crossbows\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hand crossbows\">hand crossbows</a>.</div>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212221\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1014/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6859/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2967/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 295/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 727639/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.940      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   40.940      1 -total\n 33.11%   13.556      3 Template:WeaponType\n 31.72%   12.987      3 Template:Icon_link\n 30.38%   12.436      3 Template:Icon_text\n 25.50%   10.440      6 Template:Trim\n 19.78%    8.099      3 Template:I